OL,3,GNEWSAMan dies after crashing into two
OL,4,Aparked cars
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has died after his car crashed
OL,7,Finto two parked cars in a farmer's yard
OL,8,Fin Boston.
OL,10,FA Range Rover Evoque collided with the
OL,11,Fvehicles on Mere Drove, in Old Leake,
OL,12,Fjust before 10:00 BST and the driver, a
OL,13,F62-year-old man, died at the scene,
OL,14,FLincolnshire Police said.
OL,16,FThe force said he was the only person
OL,17,Fin the car.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
